        "slug": "dl44",
        "inv": 7,
        "title": "DL-44 Hero prop",
        "medium": "",
        "description": "The DL-44 is one of the most iconic weapons in the galaxy, made famous by Han Solo, the smuggler who played a key role in the Rebellion against the Empire. This heavy blaster, based on military-grade designs, was known for its high stopping power and reliability, making it the perfect choice for skilled gunslingers.\nThe displayed piece is not just a replica. It is an authentic prop from the production of Star Wars (1977). Only three units were created for filmmaking, and this is one of the few surviving originals. Even though it is unknown whether this specific one was used in the actual filming, its intricate details, including realistic weathering and modifications for special effects, make it a rare artifact, cherished by both Star Wars fans and collectors of cinematic history.",
